about with a cold,

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:51.089
frozen universe

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:53.759
contrasted to a boiling

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:55.889
hot Earth that just kills

00:02:55.890 --> 00:02:56.489
us all.

00:02:56.490 --> 00:02:57.359
That's right. That will happen

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:58.559
first. Wonderful.

